# IKOS-PIMS — Passenger Information Management System

> A distributed, dual-stack backend proof-of-concept for modern German rail and transit networks.  
> Implements a unified Passenger Registry across **C++ (Oatpp)** and **Java (Spring Boot)** — both targeting a shared, pessimistically-locked PostgreSQL database.

