## Git Workflow

This project uses **Git Flow** with **Conventional Commits**.

### Branch naming

```
main                    → stable, tagged releases only
develop                 → integration branch
feature/<description>   → new functionality
chore/<description>     → tooling, config, docs
hotfix/<description>    → emergency production fix
```

### Commit format

```
<type>(<scope>): <short imperative summary>
```

**Types:** `feat` · `fix` · `chore` · `docs` · `test` · `refactor`  
**Scopes:** `cpp-backend` · `java-backend` · `infra`

### Example commits from this project

```
feat(cpp-backend): add PassengerController with POST and GET endpoints
feat(java-backend): add PassengerController and JPA repository
chore(infra): add docker-compose with PostgreSQL, C++ and Java services
fix(cpp-backend): resolve make_shared string conversion in controller
docs: add full project README with architecture and API reference
```

