## Roadmap

### v1.0.0 — Current (Dual-stack MVP)
- [x] C++ Oatpp backend — POST and GET passengers
- [x] Java Spring Boot backend — POST and GET passengers
- [x] Shared PostgreSQL database with pessimistic locking
- [x] Full Docker Compose orchestration
- [x] Identical REST contract across both stacks

### v1.1.0 — Architecture refactor
- [ ] Refactor C++ backend to **Hexagonal (Ports & Adapters)** architecture
  - Separate domain entity (`Passenger`) from controller and repository
  - Define `IPassengerRepository` port interface
  - Move SQL to outbound adapter, HTTP to inbound adapter
- [ ] Add ticketing-service (C++, port 8083)
- [ ] Add journey-planner service (C++, port 8084)

### v1.2.0 — Event streaming
- [ ] Apache Kafka for async domain events (`journey.delayed`, `passenger.registered`)
- [ ] display-service — real-time platform board updates via WebSocket
- [ ] notification-service — SMS/Email delay alerts

### v1.3.0 — Production hardening
- [ ] VDV 452/454 German transport data standard compliance
- [ ] Kubernetes manifests for all services
- [ ] Prometheus metrics + Grafana dashboards
- [ ] Load testing: p95 < 100ms at 500 RPS

